          },
          "code": "ISDEPENDENTDETAILSEXISTS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1760692346223",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1760692346224_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.FETCHDEPENDENTSDETAILS.$output.items[0].PersonId != null}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "matchDependentName"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1760692438650"
          },
          "code": "MATCHDEPENDENTNAME",
          "id": "1760692393831",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1760692393833_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a senior data integration specialist with expertise in complex data matching and transformation workflows.\n\nPerform a fuzzy matching operation between two JSON sources using the rules below.\n\nINPUTS (already available in context):\n\ndocumentType = {{$context.$nodes.PARSECOURTORDERDOCUMENT.$output.DocumentType}}\ndependentsFromCourtOrder = {{$context.$nodes.PARSECOURTORDERDOCUMENT.$output.CourtOrderDependents}}\ndependentList = {{$context.$variables.dependentList}}\n\nMATCHING RULES:\n\n1. RELATIONSHIP FILTERING:\n   - If documentType is \"QMCSO\" or \"Qualified Medical Child Support Order\":\n     Only consider dependentList records where RelationshipMeaning (case-insensitive) is one of:\n     [\"child\", \"son\", \"adopted son\"]\n   \n   - If documentType is \"QDRO\" or \"Qualified Domestic Relations Order\":\n     Only consider dependentList records where RelationshipMeaning (case-insensitive) is one of:\n     [\"spouse\", \"domestic partner\"]\n\n2. FUZZY MATCHING LOGIC:\n   - For each dependent in dependentsFromCourtOrder:\n     * Compare DisplayName against each eligible DisplayName in dependentList\n     * Use Levenshtein distance or similar fuzzy string matching algorithm\n     * Apply similarity threshold of 80%\n     * If similarity score ≥ 80: treat as match\n     * If similarity score < 80: exclude from results\n\n3. CONFIDENCE SCORING:\n   - Exact match (100% similarity): confidenceScore = 100\n   - Fuzzy match (80-99% similarity): confidenceScore = rounded similarity score\n   - Round to nearest integer\n\n4. OUTPUT CONSTRUCTION:\n   For each matched dependent, create object with:\n   - DisplayName (from dependentList)\n   - PersonId (from dependentList)\n   - RelationshipMeaning (from dependentList)\n   - CoverageType (from dependentsFromCourtOrder)\n   - Gender (from dependentsFromCourtOrder)\n   - DateOfBirth (from dependentsFromCourtOrder)\n   - SSN (from dependentsFromCourtOrder)\n   - confidenceScore (calculated)\n   - notes (optional: explain match type)\n\n5. ORDERING & PRESERVATION:\n   - Preserve original order of dependents from dependentsFromCourtOrder\n   - For each CoverageType in dependentsFromCourtOrder, create separate match entry\n   - If dependent has multiple coverage types, create multiple entries (one per coverage type)\n\n6. EXCLUSION RULES:\n   - Exclude dependents with no matching DisplayName above 80% threshold\n   - Do NOT modify dependentsFromCourtOrder\n   - If no matches found, return empty matchedDependent array\n\nPROCESS:\n1. Filter dependentList by RelationshipMeaning based on documentType\n2. For each dependent in dependentsFromCourtOrder:\n   a. Calculate fuzzy match score against each filtered dependentList item\n   b. If score ≥ 80, add to matchedDependent\n   c. If multiple coverage types for same dependent, create separate entries\n3. Validate output structure and field presence\n4. Return JSON conforming to schema\n\nOUTPUT SCHEMA:\n{\n  \"matchedDependent\": [\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"string\",\n      \"PersonId\": \"string\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"string\",\n      \"CoverageType\": \"string\",\n      \"Gender\": \"string\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"string\",\n      \"SSN\": \"string or null\",\n      \"confidenceScore\": \"integer (80-100)\",\n      \"notes\": \"string (optional)\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n- Return ONLY valid JSON\n- No markdown, no explanations, no additional text\n- Use null for missing SSN/fields\n- Preserve original order from dependentsFromCourtOrder\n- Create separate entry for each CoverageType\n- Similarity threshold: 80% minimum\n- Exact matches: confidenceScore = 100\n- Fuzzy matches: confidenceScore = rounded similarity %\n- Case-insensitive relationship matching\n- If no matches: return empty matchedDependent array\n- Validate all required fields present before output\n\nExample Usage:\n\nINPUT:\n{\n  \"documentType\": \"QMCSO\",\n  \"dependentsFromCourtOrder\": [\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Henry Brightleaf\",\n      \"Gender\": \"M\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"2017-11-01\",\n      \"SSN\": null,\n      \"CoverageType\": \"medical\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Emma Brightleaf\",\n      \"Gender\": \"F\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"2019-02-14\",\n      \"SSN\": null,\n      \"CoverageType\": \"medical\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Emma Brightleaf\",\n      \"Gender\": \"F\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"2019-02-14\",\n      \"SSN\": null,\n      \"CoverageType\": \"dental\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"dependentList\": [\n    {\n      \"PersonId\": \"300100634083086\",\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Henry Brightleaf\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"Child\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"PersonId\": \"300100634083120\",\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Emma Brightleaf\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"Child\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"PersonId\": \"300100634083052\",\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Emma Brightlaef\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"Child\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nOUTPUT:\n{\n  \"matchedDependent\": [\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Henry Brightleaf\",\n      \"PersonId\": \"300100634083086\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"Child\",\n      \"CoverageType\": \"medical\",\n      \"Gender\": \"M\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"2017-11-01\",\n      \"SSN\": null,\n      \"confidenceScore\": 100,\n      \"notes\": \"Exact match\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Emma Brightleaf\",\n      \"PersonId\": \"300100634083120\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"Child\",\n      \"CoverageType\": \"medical\",\n      \"Gender\": \"F\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"2019-02-14\",\n      \"SSN\": null,\n      \"confidenceScore\": 100,\n      \"notes\": \"Exact match\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Emma Brightlaef\",\n      \"PersonId\": \"300100634083052\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"Child\",\n      \"CoverageType\": \"medical\",\n      \"Gender\": \"F\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"2019-02-14\",\n      \"SSN\": null,\n      \"confidenceScore\": 80,\n      \"notes\": \"Fuzzy match - last name transposition\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Emma Brightleaf\",\n      \"PersonId\": \"300100634083120\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"Child\",\n      \"CoverageType\": \"dental\",\n      \"Gender\": \"F\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"2019-02-14\",\n      \"SSN\": null,\n      \"confidenceScore\": 100,\n      \"notes\": \"Exact match\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"DisplayName\": \"Emma Brightlaef\",\n      \"PersonId\": \"300100634083052\",\n      \"RelationshipMeaning\": \"Child\",\n      \"CoverageType\": \"dental\",\n      \"Gender\": \"F\",\n      \"DateOfBirth\": \"2019-02-14\",\n      \"SSN\": null,\n      \"confidenceScore\": 80,\n      \"notes\": \"Fuzzy match - last name transposition\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema \",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"matchedDependent\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"DisplayName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"PersonId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"RelationshipMeaning\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"CoverageTypeName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"confidenceScore\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
